KAMUI MP+rl-aq
"Message passing through a Zalasr store-release and load-acquire: release and acquire at system scope (K2), which synchronize: forbidden."
{
x=0;
y=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 1,gpu 0 ;
 sw x, 1        | lw.aq r0, y    ;
 sw.rl y, 1     | lw r1, x       ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
